000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TCSDLCDE.
000400 AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         JAN 23, 1987.
000600 INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*D REMARKS.            THIS PROGRAM WILL DELETE ALL CODES
000900*D                     OUT OF ACCOUNTING DATA BASE THAT HAVE
001000*D                     BEEN DELETED OUT OF CSIS IF ALL UNITS
001100*D                     AND DOLLARS HAVE BEEN CLEARED OUT OF CODE.
001200*D                     AN EXCEPTION REPORT WILL ALSO BE PRINTED
001300*D                     OF ALL CODES THAT CANNOT BE DELETED
001400*D                     BECAUSE OF AN EXISTING BALANCE ON CODE.
001500*D
      *C 25JUN92          DAVE PLUM         REQUEST #6227
      *C CHANGED ALL REFERENCES WITHIN THE PROGRAM TO "TDELCODE" TO
      *C READ "TCSDLCDE".  THIS PROGRAM WAS ORIGINALLY NAMED TDELCODE
      *C ON THE HP-3000 PRIOR TO "THE CONVERSION".  DURING THE
      *C CONVERSION IT TOOK ON ITS NEW NAME: TCSDLCDE.  HOWEVER, NOT
      *C ALL REFERENCES TO THE OLD NAME WERE CHANGED.
      *C
      *C   7/7/93.    M. L. MITCHELL    REQUEST PAR D. PLUM, #
      *C     REMOVE ALL REFERENCE TO DSET DAAPLFRT (MCFLCA0800).
      *C     ALL LOGICAL, COPYLIB AND WORKING STORAGE REFERENCES
      *C     WERE DELETED.
      *C
      *C   07FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   09/16/1996   CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
001600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
001900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
002000 SPECIAL-NAMES.        C01 IS TOP-OF-FORM.
002100
002200 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002300 FILE-CONTROL.
002400     SELECT ONLINE-PRT   ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
002500     SELECT SORT-FILE    ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
           SELECT MACTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MATLACUM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DTRANS-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
002700
