004900     05  SORT-BEG-UNITS           PIC S9(10).
005000     05  SORT-BEG-DOLLARS         PIC S9(12)V99.
005100     05  SORT-UNITS-RNI           PIC S9(10).
005200     05  SORT-RCPT-DOLLARS        PIC S9(12)V99.
005300     05  SORT-UNITS-INR           PIC S9(10).
005400     05  SORT-DOLLARS-INR         PIC S9(12)V99.
005500
       FD  MACTINFO-I
