           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0701.
       FD  MSTORERM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.
005700
